---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageStyles from '../../components/PageStyles.astro';
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="Opportunities Radar | Territorium Capital"
  description="A funding and profitability opportunities radar for landowners and asset managers, matching land data with open and upcoming funding calls."
  canonicalPath="/en/opportunities/"
  alternateEsPath="/oportunidades/"
>
  <PageStyles />

  <main>
    <section class="seo-page-hero seo-page-hero--opportunities">
      <div class="seo-page-hero__inner">
        <span class="section-kicker section-kicker--light">Opportunities</span>
        <h1>Identify funding and profitability opportunities.</h1>
        <p>
          We match your land data with open and upcoming funding calls to assess
          eligibility, estimated value and next steps.
        </p>
        <div class="seo-page-hero__actions">
          <a class="seo-cta seo-cta--solid" href="mailto:blanca@territorium.capital">Request an assessment</a>
          <a class="seo-cta" href="/en/">Back to Territorium</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="seo-section seo-section--white">
      <div class="container seo-two-col">
        <div>
          <span class="section-kicker">The problem</span>
          <h2>Funding is often lost because there is no radar.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="seo-copy">
          <p>
            Calls open and close quickly. Between European funds,
            agri-environmental schemes, insurance, energy, digitalisation,
            restoration and regional programmes, opportunities are often missed
            because they arrive too late or because eligibility is unclear.
          </p>
          <p>
            Territorium turns that noise into a practical decision: which calls
            fit the asset, what estimated value they may bring, what information
            is required and whether it is worth applying.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="seo-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <span class="section-kicker">What you receive</span>
          <h2>A monthly report with real opportunities.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="seo-card-grid seo-card-grid--four">
          <article class="seo-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Timely alerts</h3>
            <p>Relevant opportunities before deadlines are already too close.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="seo-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Only what fits</h3>
            <p>Cross-checking with asset data: location, surface area, uses, crops and constraints.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="seo-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Clear recommendation</h3>
            <p>Eligibility, estimated value, required documentation and whether to apply or not.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="seo-card">
            <span>04</span>
            <h3>Full execution</h3>
            <p>When an opportunity is worth pursuing, we support the file, submission and follow-up.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="regenera-analysis">
      <div class="container regenera-analysis__grid">
        <div class="regenera-analysis__media">
          <img src="/imagenes/servicio-diagnostico-capas.png" alt="Territorial data layers used to identify opportunities">
        </div>
        <div class="regenera-analysis__copy">
          <span class="section-kicker">Opportunities Radar</span>
          <h2>Land data, funding calls and decision-making in one view.</h2>
          <p>
            The objective is not to apply to everything. It is to identify the
            opportunities that fit the territory and discard quickly those that
            consume time without a reasonable probability of return.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Asset data.</strong> Surface area, uses, location, crops, restrictions and potential.</li>
            <li><strong>Funding calls.</strong> Open, upcoming and recurring opportunities by category.</li>
            <li><strong>Decision.</strong> Eligibility, estimated value, documentation effort and recommendation.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="seo-section seo-section--white">
      <div class="container seo-two-col">
        <div>
          <span class="section-kicker">Model</span>
          <h2>Territorial profitability with discipline.</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="seo-list">
          <li><strong>Annual report from EUR 1,200 + VAT per asset.</strong> No permanence and no obligation to activate any specific call.</li>
          <li><strong>If an application is submitted.</strong> Fixed preparation fee plus success-based component if the funding is awarded.</li>
          <li><strong>First step.</strong> Initial review of relevant funding awarded in recent years to comparable assets.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="regenera-disclaimer">
      <div class="container">
        <p>
          The Opportunities Radar does not guarantee funding approval. Its role
          is to detect fit, prioritise calls and reduce the opportunity cost of
          arriving late or applying to what does not match the asset.
        </p>
        <a href="mailto:blanca@territorium.capital" class="seo-cta">Request an assessment</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
